  "referenceNumber": "RUS1045",
  "remarks": "\nAleksandr Vladimirovich GUTSAN is a Member of the Security Council and Deputy Prime Minister of the Russian Federation. As a Member of the Security Council, GUTSAN is or has been responsible for, engaged in, provided support for or promoted policies or actions which destabilise Ukraine and undermine or threaten the territorial integrity, sovereignty or independence of Ukraine.\n The trust services sanctions were imposed on 21/03/2023.",
